From: FireTabs contributors
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: mt8163: include thermal binding constants

The pinned community MT8163 DTS uses THERMAL_NO_LIMIT in thermal maps without
including its binding definition. Standalone preprocessing leaves those tokens
unexpanded and dtc 1.8.1 rejects them. Use the real ACK thermal binding header.
This fixes a compile dependency only and does not validate thermal behavior.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt8163.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt8163.dtsi
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@
 
 #include <dt-bindings/interrupt-controller/arm-gic.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/phy/phy.h>
+#include <dt-bindings/thermal/thermal.h>
 
 #include <dt-bindings/clock/mediatek,mt8163-audsys.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/clock/mediatek,mt8163-apmixedsys.h>
